<translate>
'''Random Sound Events''' is an API built for [[Build 41]] which allows modders to provide a set of random world sound events that can happen randomly. These sounds are more commonly refered to as [[Metagame|meta events]] which are not tied to anything that could be found in the world directly, but rather events that occur off-screen and are implied to happen within the game world (e.g. distant gunfire, thunder or animal sounds).
</translate>
